# --- Build artifact (regenerable via `packwiz modrinth export`) ---
# The .mrpack is a seed/backup only; attach to a GitHub Release rather than tracking a 12MB binary.
*.mrpack

# --- Per-user / per-OS generated data (mirrors .packignore) ---
mods/mcef-libraries/
xaero/world-map/
.fabric/
.cache/
.mixin.out/
screenshots/
crash-reports/
logs/
saves/
usercache.json
*.log

# --- OS cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# NOTE: the 6 bundled jars in mods/*.jar ARE intentionally committed —
# hosted packwiz distribution needs them reachable at the repo's raw URL.

# Internal build-handoff note — not for the public members repo
*.md
!README.md
!docs/*.md
!resourcepacks/lowlands-vanity/ATTRIBUTION.md
# NOTE: resourcepacks/lowlands-vanity/ was formerly git-ignored while Clothing of
# the Lowlands' redistribution permission was pending. Permission was granted by
# Anton_Vaedak on 2026-08-16 to ship these assets inside this modpack (packwiz),
# non-commercial, with in-game CurseForge attribution and no third-party reuse, so
# the pack is now committed and indexed. See resourcepacks/lowlands-vanity/ATTRIBUTION.md.

# Python bytecode (mms-ship.py imports mms-repos.py)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
